  date         = {2025-02},
  abstract     = {AbstractThis paper proposes new origins for tense vowels in
                  Tangut by integrating textual analysis of Tangut texts with
                  comparative data from both Gyalrongic and other Sino-Tibetan
                  languages. It uncovers two previously unreported sources of
                  vowel tensing in compounding: the collective prefix (*S-) and
